#3300
A Scraggly Trail~
   A faint trail leaves the main road to the west and climbs east into rocky
hill country. Grey stone and grey mountain grass make it hard to follow, and
the refugees who come this way often lose it. A weathered signboard stands
here, out of place in such rough country. The trail climbs east.
