E
bed~
Lucky! Under the scorched pillow is a half-written letter, unaddressed. The
words not burnt or smeared speak of the smith-mage Gabadiel's masterwork: a
sword of unequalled power, and two blades that came before it, set aside as
"not yet what I was working toward". The letter ends: "The company has
offered again. I will not sell these to be thrown away on the wall." Looking
around, you see no swords at all.
~
